<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nPlotActionSet<dd>the set defined in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Plotactions.xls" title="Plotactionsets">plotactionsets</a> 2DA to be set active. 0 hides the plot action GUI
