<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>This function shows the "army picker" GUI in the upper right of the screen with a set of up to four actions that the player can pick from it. See <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Plotactions.xls" title="Plotactions.xls">plotactions.xls</a> for how to set up a set of plot actions to be displayed here.
</p>
